    <item>
      <title>🔥 Hot off the press from my 𝗔𝗴𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗰 𝗦𝗼𝗳𝘁𝘄𝗮𝗿𝗲 𝗙𝗮𝗰𝘁𝗼𝗿𝘆!!</title>
      <link>https://rmoff.net/cuttings/2026/11/10/hot-off-the-press-from-my-agentic-software-factory/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:18:55 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://rmoff.net/cuttings/2026/11/10/hot-off-the-press-from-my-agentic-software-factory/</guid>
      <description>&lt;article class=&#34;cutting cutting-own&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&lt;div class=&#34;cutting-meta&#34; data-pagefind-ignore&gt;Posted on &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7525924958615851008&#34;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; &lt;span aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt; &lt;time class=&#34;cutting-date&#34; datetime=&#34;2026-11-10&#34;&gt;10 Nov 2026&lt;/time&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&lt;div class=&#34;cutting-text&#34;&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔥 Hot off the press from my 𝗔𝗴𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗰 𝗦𝗼𝗳𝘁𝘄𝗮𝗿𝗲 𝗙𝗮𝗰𝘁𝗼𝗿𝘆!! ⚙️⚙️&#xA;💡 #Inspired by Kafka, 𝗞𝗮𝗳𝘂𝗰𝗸 is a 𝙗𝙧𝙤𝙠𝙚𝙧 𝙛𝙤𝙧 𝙩𝙝𝙚 𝘼𝙄 𝙖𝙜𝙚.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;⚡ As you&amp;rsquo;d expect with any modern Kafka, it&amp;rsquo;s diskless. In fact, it&amp;rsquo;s 𝘤𝘰𝘮𝘱𝘭𝘦𝘵𝘦𝘭𝘺 diskless.&#xA;📊 In benchmarks (which I&amp;rsquo;ve shared too, you can check the numbers) it&amp;rsquo;s 𝗢𝗩𝗘𝗥 𝟮𝟬,𝟬𝟬𝟬 𝘁𝗶𝗺𝗲𝘀 𝗳𝗮𝘀𝘁𝗲𝗿 than Kafka! 𝘞𝘩𝘪𝘤𝘩 𝘪𝘴, 𝘱𝘳𝘦𝘵𝘵𝘺 𝘧𝘢𝘴𝘵.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;🚀 #Proud and #Humbled to announce that Kafuck is now 𝗳𝘂𝗹𝗹𝘆 𝗼𝗽𝗲𝗻 𝘀𝗼𝘂𝗿𝗰𝗲.&#xA;⭐ Try it out, 𝘀𝘁𝗮𝗿 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗿𝗲𝗽𝗼, and let me know what you think&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;🔗 &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/rmoff/kafuck/&#34;&gt;https://github.com/rmoff/kafuck/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;#kafka #opensource #diskless #blazinglyfast #firstprinciples #buildinpublic #ai #hashtag #makenomistakes&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#x9;&lt;figure class=&#34;cutting-media&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://rmoff.net/cuttings/2026/11/10/hot-off-the-press-from-my-agentic-software-factory/image-1.gif&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; width=&#34;886&#34; height=&#34;694&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/article&gt;&#xA;</description>
    </item>
